sequenceDiagram
    %% write_reflection with its source check
    actor agent as Agent
    participant mcp as MCP server
    participant engine as Engine
    actor person as Person
    agent->>mcp: write_reflection
    mcp->>engine: check the sources
    critical every source is readable
        engine->>engine: read each source
    option a source is too wide
        engine-->>mcp: too wide
        mcp-->>agent: ask the person
        agent->>person: narrow it down?
        person-->>agent: yes, this folder
    end
    engine-->>mcp: stored
    mcp-->>agent: reflection id
